what this newfound success means for each of them. This episode captures the team's incredible journey by blending past, present, and future in a vibrant, dynamic way. The past is revisited through a fast-paced visual recap of previous seasons, while the present is depicted by showcasing the team's accomplishments—trophies, merchandise, video games, and interviews, all taking place in their workshop. The future is symbolized by a new creation, embodying our protagonist’s relentless focus on driving, competing, and, of course, winning. Also this was a fantastic opportunity for me to experiment with different visual styles for these beloved characters, including the adorable Chibi Chiaki and the striking video game pixel art."]}]},{"tag":"figure","attrs":{"class":"director-note__name director-note__name--fig"},"children":[{"tag":"picture","attrs":{"class":"base-image"},"children":[{"tag":"img","attrs":{"class":"base-image__img","src":"/assets/1725890502-juanpe_arroyo-b0e0af4070.webp","width":"1","height":"1","alt":"","loading":"lazy","decoding":"async"},"children":[]}]}]}]}]}]},{"tag":"button","attrs":{"aria-label":"Close director's note","class":"director-note__close"},"children":[]}]}],"meta":{"videoUrls":[{"key":"videoUrl","url":"https://studio-media.henrywithu.workers.dev/videos/vimeo/1000349340-1080p.mp4"},{"key":"videoUrl","url":"https://studio-media.henrywithu.workers.dev/videos/vimeo/1003260569-1080p.mp4"},{"key":"videoUrl","url":"https://studio-media.henrywithu.workers.dev/videos/vimeo/1001536158-1080p.mp4"}]}}
